# README GUIDANCE

> **Reference** for extraction patterns and Mermaid diagrams

---

## 1. EXTRACTION PATTERNS

### POM.XML Extraction
| Element | Extract | Use In |
|---------|---------|--------|
| `<artifactId>` | Project name | Title, badges |
| `<version>` | Version | Badge |
| `<description>` | Purpose | Overview |
| `<app.runtime>` | MuleSoft version | Tech stack |
| `<dependencies>` | Connectors | Tech stack |

### Badge Formatting
<!-- Integrated: 2026-01-16 -->

Use plain text metadata format. **DO NOT** use external SVG badges (shields.io URLs).

```markdown
**Version:** 1.0.1-SNAPSHOT | **MuleSoft Runtime:** 4.9.0+ | **Status:** Active | **Type:** Event-Driven
```

### Flow File Extraction
| Type | Identifier | Document As |
|------|------------|-------------|
| API Flow | `http:listener` | API Endpoint |
| Batch Flow | `batch:job` | Batch Process |
| Scheduled | `scheduler` | Scheduled Job |
| Sub-flow | `<sub-flow>` | Reusable Component |
| Error Handler | `error-handler` | Error Handling |

### Configuration Extraction
| Pattern | Type | Document As |
|---------|------|-------------|
| `${property.name}` | Property | Environment variable |
| `${secure::prop}` | Secure | Secure config (name only) |
| `${env.VAR_NAME}` | Environment | Required env var |

