## 2. MERMAID DIAGRAM STRATEGY

> **Rule**: Mermaid ONLY - NO ASCII, NO PlantUML
> **Placement**: Per template (see `templates/readme-template-guide.md`)

### Required: 2 Diagrams Minimum

| # | Diagram | Mermaid Type |
|---|---------|--------------|
| 1 | System/Integration | `flowchart TB` |
| 2 | Flow/Process | `flowchart TD` |

### Diagram 1: System Architecture
```mermaid
flowchart TB
    subgraph "External"
        Client["🌐 Client"]
        SF["☁️ Salesforce"]
    end
    subgraph "MuleSoft"
        API["API Gateway"]
        Flow["Main Flow"]
    end
    Client --> API --> Flow --> SF
```

### Diagram 2: Flow Process
```mermaid
flowchart TD
    Start["📨 Request"] --> Validate{Validate}
    Validate -->|Valid| Process["Process"]
    Validate -->|Invalid| Error["400 Error"]
    Process --> Transform["Transform"]
    Transform --> Response["✅ Response"]
```

### Extraction → Mermaid Mapping
| Extracted | Mermaid Element |
|-----------|------------------|
| `http:listener` | `A[HTTP Request]` |
| `scheduler` | `A["⏰ Trigger"]` |
| `http:request` | Target subgraph node |
| `db:select` | `["🗄️ Database"]` |
| `sftp:read` | `["📁 SFTP"]` |
| `error-handler` | `{Decision}` branch |

