## 8. FEW-SHOT PATTERNS

### Badge Format

❌ BAD - External SVG badges:
```markdown
![Version](https://img.shields.io/badge/version-1.0.0-blue)
```

✅ GOOD - Plain text metadata:
```markdown
**Version:** 1.0.1-SNAPSHOT | **MuleSoft Runtime:** 4.9.0+ | **Status:** Active
```

**Why**: External SVG badges break in enterprise environments behind firewalls.

### Diagram Format

❌ BAD - ASCII art:
```
+--------+    +--------+
| Client | -> | Server |
+--------+    +--------+
```

✅ GOOD - Mermaid flowchart:
```mermaid
flowchart TB
    Client["🌐 Client"] --> Server["🖥️ Server"]
```

**Why**: Mermaid renders natively in GitHub/GitLab. ASCII art breaks with different fonts.
